# Firebase Backend

## Firebase Services Used

- **Auth** — email/password authentication
- **Firestore** — document database (all app data)
- **Storage** — sermon audio files, event images, profile photos
- **Analytics** — initialized in `services/firebase.js`
- **Hosting** — SPA deployment from `dist/`

## Firestore Data Models

### `users/{uid}`
```
{
  uid: string,
  email: string,
  displayName: string,
  role: "member" | "admin" | "super-admin",
  phone?, address?, city?, state?, zip?, dateOfBirth?, occupation?,
  ministryInterests?, bio?, emergencyContactName?, emergencyContactPhone?,
  createdAt: Timestamp,
  updatedAt?: Timestamp
}
```

### `userMinistries/{uid}_{ministryId}`
Junction docs linking members to ministries with a per-ministry role. Managed from **Admin → Users** (super-admin).

```
{
  uid: string,
  ministryId: string,   // ministries/{id}
  role: "member" | "leader" | "coordinator" | "volunteer",
  note?: string,
  createdAt: Timestamp,
  updatedAt: Timestamp
}
```

Service: `src/services/userMinistriesService.js` (`listUserMinistries`, `replaceUserMinistries`). Role constants in `src/lib/ministryRoles.js`.

