## Security Rules Summary

| Collection | Read | Create | Update/Delete |
|-----------|------|--------|---------------|
| `users/{uid}` | Owner or admin | Auth user (own doc) | Owner or admin |
| `events` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `sermons` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `siteSettings` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `youthVideos` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `youthPageContent` | Public | Admin | Admin |
| `contactMessages` | Admin | Anyone (public) | Admin |
| `prayerRequests` | Admin | Anyone (public) | Admin |
| `churchProfileUpdates` | Admin | Any auth user | Admin |

Admin check reads from `users/{uid}.role == 'admin'`.

## Storage Paths

| Path | Public Read | Write |
|------|-----------|-------|
| `sermons/audio/{sermonId}/{filename}` | Yes | Admin |
| `events/{allPaths}` | Yes | Admin |
| `profiles/{uid}/{allPaths}` | Yes | Owner or admin |
| `media/{allPaths}` | Yes | Staff (admin / super-admin) |

## Firestore Indexes

1. `events` — `date ASC`
2. `sermons` — `category ASC, date DESC` (for category filter)
3. `sermons` — `date DESC` (for default listing)

## Service Files

| File | Responsibility |
|------|---------------|
| `firebase.js` | Initialize app, export `auth`, `db`, `storage`, `analytics` |
| `authService.js` | Register, login, logout, password reset, get profile, auth state listener |
| `eventsService.js` | CRUD for events collection |
| `sermonsService.js` | CRUD for sermons + audio upload to Storage |
| `contactService.js` | Submit contact form and prayer requests; admin read of messages |
| `missingDataService.js` | Submit church profile updates |
| `siteSettingsService.js` | Read/write `siteSettings/churchInfo` and `siteSettings/giving` |
| `youthVideosService.js` | CRUD for `youthVideos` (create/update/delete), `youthPageContent/main` (merge write with `sanitizeYouthPageContentForSave` / `normalizeYouthPageContent`), `getYoutubeVideoId` for thumbnails/embeds |
| `mediaService.js` | List / upload / delete files under Storage `media/` (admin Media library page) |
| `usersAdminService.js` | Paginated `userIndex` directory, profile fetch, role + profile updates (super-admin) |
| `userMinistriesService.js` | CRUD-style `userMinistries` junction (member ↔ ministry + role) |
| `ministriesService.js` | CRUD for `ministries` CMS pages + nav builder |

### `youthPageContent/main` (single document)

All public copy for the Youth & Children page is editable in **Admin → Youth & Children**. Persisted fields include bilingual strings for hero, optional intro spotlight, stats row (“At a glance”), ministry card section titles and three cards, FAQ section title, videos section titles and empty-state copy, bottom CTA (heading, button labels, `ctaHref`), plus:

```
faqs: Array<{ questionEn, questionAm, answerEn, answerAm }>
```

`updatedAt` is set on write; do not send Firestore metadata from the form — the service strips to `YOUTH_PAGE_STRING_KEYS` + `faqs`.

### `youthVideos/{id}`

```
{
  title, titleAm, description, descriptionAm, url,
  speaker?, category?, duration?, thumbnailUrl?, sortOrder?,
  createdAt, updatedAt
}
```

Public page uses click-to-play embeds; thumbnail defaults to YouTube still if `thumbnailUrl` is empty.
